Full rebuild as Next 14 + TypeScript + React, output:'export': every page
prerenders to plain HTML for crawlers and AI agents.

Identity: paper and evening light. Cream ground, serif display voice,
terracotta-rose accents — the softest member of the network family, on
purpose: this surface humanizes; the dashboards live elsewhere.

Signature: a slow generative sky behind the hero — the sun's height follows
the visitor's local time of day, cloud bands breathe across the gradient
(honors prefers-reduced-motion). Plus 'The journey so far': a serif timeline
from Aachen to Frankfurt to the network to the manuscripts.

Four locales sharing the network's vg-locale key, ProfilePage+Person JSON-LD,
the Grimaldi mark, headshot committed at 280px, vercel.json pinning the
static build.
